UniProt  --  CC BY 4.0
    Files: data/target_registry.json, data/targets/*.json, and every runs/*/input.yaml
           whose folded chain is a substring of a canonical sequence recorded in the
           registry. The criterion is stated rather than a count, because a count goes
           stale every time a fold is added; the test suite checks the criterion selects a
           non-empty set and that no file it selects is left unnamed.
    Content: canonical protein sequences and feature annotations.
    Attribution: UniProt Consortium. https://www.uniprot.org/
    Cite: UniProt Consortium. UniProt: the Universal Protein Knowledgebase.
