PubChem  --  public domain (US Government work)
    Files: data/curated.json, data/dataset.json (isomeric SMILES, InChIKeys, CIDs).
    Attribution: PubChem, NCBI/NLM. https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/

AlphaFold Protein Structure Database  --  CC BY 4.0
    Files: data/alphafold_db/*/AF-*.cif and data/alphafold_db/*/AF-*-predicted_aligned_error.json
    Content: predicted coordinates with per-residue pLDDT in the B-factor column, and the
             predicted aligned error matrix, for the 16 UniProt accessions in the target
             registry. Downloaded from https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/, not computed here.
    Cite: Jumper J, et al. Highly accurate protein structure prediction with AlphaFold.
          Nature 596:583-589 (2021); Varadi M, et al. AlphaFold Protein Structure Database
          in 2024. Nucleic Acids Res 52:D368-D375 (2024).
    NOTE: AlphaFold SERVER was not used. Its terms prohibit automated use for predicting
    protein-ligand or protein-peptide binding, which is what studies #9 and #10 do. The
    Database is a separate, openly licensed resource of published monomer predictions.

