    Files: the PREDICTED artefacts under runs/ -- *_model_*.cif, confidence_*.json,
           pae_*.npz, plddt_*.npz, affinity_*.json -- and data/pae/*.json, which are
           those same pae_*.npz arrays re-encoded as JSON so a browser can read them.
           A change of container is not a change of provenance.
    Generated locally with Boltz-2 v2.2.1, whose code AND weights are MIT.
    Cite: Passaro S, et al. Boltz-2: Towards Accurate and Efficient Binding
          Affinity Prediction (2025); Wohlwend J, et al. Boltz-1 (2024).

    NOT covered by this entry, though they live in the same tree:

      Every runs/*/input.yaml is an INPUT, not a model output. Those whose folded chain is a
      substring of a canonical sequence recorded in data/target_registry.json carry
      UniProt content under CC BY 4.0 (see the
      UniProt entry above), and 17 carry a ChEMBL ligand SMILES under CC BY-SA 3.0 (see
