      produced them; they are CC0 (see the RCSB entry above). The earlier wording, which
      placed all of runs/** under this MIT entry, made an affirmative false statement of
      provenance about those 32 files.

Derived indices  --  no new third-party content, but the upstream terms flow through
    Files: data/slate.json, data/structures.json, data/alphafold_db_comparison.json
           (and their .js twins, which are the same objects in a form a browser can load
